Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:26.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《圣朱尼佩罗》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:23.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:17.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:33.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:11.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:01.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琳达·卡莱儿带来的1987年至今最热单曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belinda Carlisle there with one of the biggest hits of 1987 so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你们会爱上这首歌的 我们马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta love that track! Coming up next in just a moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能别闹了 我只想找点乐子好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you please stop it? I just wanna have some fun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯丽 - 我在走路看不见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kelly. - I'm still walking, Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩几小时了 别浪费啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only got a couple of hours so let's, uh… let's use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有浪费啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找了份工作 倒还凑合 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Got a job, that's okay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就是得日夜工作 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But they've got me workin' night and day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打卡上班 打卡下班 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Punching in, punching out ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这难道就是工作的所有意义吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is this really what it's all about? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你将来要做什么 会有如何感受 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What you gonna do, what you gonna feel? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不知道 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你会如何感受 你将来要做什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What you gonna feel, what you gonna do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 谁来告诉我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Won't someone tell me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你要说什么 你要做什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What you gonna say, what you gonna do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一件事可以说 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's only one thing left to say ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是生活 这就是生活 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ C'est la vie, c'est la vie ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生活本就如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's just the way it goes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是生活 这就是生活 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ C'est la vie, c'est la vie ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很擅长这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它 呃 有不同的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh… got different endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于你是一个人还是两个人玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depending on if you're in one or two player.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是第一个有如此设定的游戏 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was kinda the first game to do that. - Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩极速吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna play Top Speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我只想自己熟悉熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I just wanna get my bearings a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待会见 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you around? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我说的所有话你都要表示赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go along with whatever I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不管我说什么 你赞同就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - Whatever I say, go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 韦斯 你现在只是在纠缠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Wes, you're just pestering now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的要我亮红灯举报你吗 - 两小时三十五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I have to red light you? - Two hours 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么时间了 - 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's not much time left. - Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上周 我们那么棒的 - 都过去的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last week, we had the most amazing… - Last week was last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟我的朋友说话好吗 有一阵没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk with my friend here, okay? Haven't seen her in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯 她病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes, she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重到只有六个月可活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like "six months to live" sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 只剩五个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟她好好叙叙旧 私人时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to catch up with her. Private time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 对不起 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I'm sorry. - That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你死了一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个「只有六个月可活」的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole "six months to live" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对不起 是五个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接茬技能也是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five was a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯丽 - 约克夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kelly. - Yorkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尤基 - 约克夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yurgie? - Yorkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约克夏狗的约克夏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the dog breed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人不坏 我觉得自己还挺过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a bad guy. I feel kinda bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在泥潭碰见他的 - 泥潭是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Met him at the Quagmire so… - What's the Quagmire?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不知道那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't already know what the Quagmire is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计你也不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you probably don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 我 - 哈 你要的 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, I… - Yeah, you do. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,非得牵着你的绳才走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to tug your leash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 金发女郎 - 你瞎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Blondie. - I'm Blondie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 喊的就是你 威士忌可乐两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are. Jack and Coke times two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 我的那份只要可乐 - 两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. Mine was just a Coke. - Times two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做什么 - 我在 打量你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm… regarding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我在被监测呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm being analysed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么戴眼镜 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why the glasses? - Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢 很衬你 但你视力不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like them. They totally work on you. But do you need them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 镜片没有度数的 - 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, the lenses don't do anything. - Knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前在学校的时候我就戴着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wear them in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得现在眼镜其实是一种慰藉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess now they're just kind of a… comfort thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看倒像是种时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured they were kind of a fashion statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 但你其他的装扮又不时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - But then the rest of your outfit is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 很别具一格 我的意思是 你看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take that wrong. It's refreshing. I mean, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们竭尽全力将自己伪装成想象中的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}People try so hard to look how they think they should look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概都是电影里看来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably saw it in some movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我喜欢你的打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠于最本真的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're authentically you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没喝过酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never tasted it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有一阵没喝了 倒是挺好喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just haven't had it in a while. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 呃 - 游客吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Oh, uh… - Tourist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当你游客吧 所以是第一次来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go with tourist. So you're new here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一夜 - 哇 第一夜 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First night. - First night? Wow, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这音乐我们一定得舞上一曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to dance to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱俩吗 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With each other? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢不 我不是那种会跳舞的人 - 嘿 我们别给自己瞎定义好伐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. Dance floors aren't my thing. - Oh, let's not limit ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不行的 - 你可以的 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I can't. - Yes, you can, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我会看上去很傻的 - 我带着你就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'll look dumb… - Just follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你名字叫帕蒂 现在又说是凯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Your name was Patty, but now it's Kay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 女孩 你怎么每天都在换名字 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Girl, you seem to change it every day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但现在变短了 你说∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But now it's short, you say ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我剪短了发 但是地板上却什么发也没看见 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I got it cut, but I don't see no hair upon the floor ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每当我和你出去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Whenever I go out with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我都会有新的发现 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I find out something new ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 宝贝 你是个骗子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You're a fake, baby ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你没法掩盖的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You can't conceal it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道是因为我感觉到了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Know how I know 'cause I can feel it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是个骗子 宝贝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You're a fake, baby… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么跑了 - 噢对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did you run away? - Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我说过 我不太会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I said I'm not much of a dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,少胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚你就像冰面上手足无措的小马一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a frightened horse on a frozen lake back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑啦 也不全是玩笑啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding. Half kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我强迫你跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I pushed you into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周一次的周末之夜 时不我待 我就变得有些不耐烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturday nights once a week. It's like no time. I get impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不是这样的 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's not that. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人都在看我们 - 看我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone was looking. - Looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 看两个女孩在跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know, two girls dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先 人们已经不像从前那么拘谨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one, folks are way less uptight than they used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再者 这是派对小城 没人会去评头论足\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two, this is a party town. No one's judging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 即使他们在盯着看 也是因为我舞姿曼妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it. If they were staring, it's because I am bodacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 傻缺 - 谢谢哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're stupid. - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从来没进过舞池 - 从来没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've never been on a dance floor. - Never?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活了这么久 从来没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in the whole time you've been alive never?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么物种啊 阿米什人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, like, Amish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是稀缺物种呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one sheltered existence you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人什么都不让我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as my family's concerned, I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 我做的烂事可都是瞒着家人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one knows about even half the shit I get up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们这样的家伙 一定都来自爱意满满的家庭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your folks, though, it's from a place of love, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会担心 - 他们才不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They worry. - They don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到我开开心心的 他们都会受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the concept of me enjoying myself would blow their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么呢 有什么是你没做过却想做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like to do? That you've never done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣胡尼佩罗可是座派对小城\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Junipero is a party town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来者有份哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All up for grabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两个小时才午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midnight's two hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 快了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么要坐这里耗费人生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why waste time sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen… - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我是说 - 真的 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I mean… - Really, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我 啊 我订婚了 我有未婚夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm, uh… I'm engaged. I have a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫格雷格 - 格雷格在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's called Greg. - And is Greg here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 他在 - 别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's… - Elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:11:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和我上床吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna go to bed with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住的地方离这很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be back at mine in like…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前都没这样过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never did anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才要体验一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the more reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 真的 不能 - 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just… I can't. - I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 - 冒雨走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to go. - In this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been really great to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 女友处于昏迷状态 我知道 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Girlfriend in a coma, I know, I know, it's… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将独自一人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll be alone… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱人的影子翩翩起舞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The shadow of a lover goes dancing by… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你对爱情上瘾 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You're addicted to love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还是承认吧 你对爱情上瘾 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Might as well face it you're addicted to love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:13:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还是承认吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Might as well… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我许愿得到爱情 得到能亲吻和倾诉的许愿井 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Wish me love a wishing well to kiss and tell ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 蝴蝶之泪的许愿井 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A wishing well of butterfly tear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我许愿得到爱情 得到能亲吻和倾诉的许愿井 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Wish me love a wishing well to kiss and tell ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 鳄鱼之悦的许愿井 唱吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A wishing well of crocodile cheers, sing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么鬼 韦斯 - 听着 我知道我过界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell, Wes? - Look, I know I'm coming across…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要亮红灯举报你了 没开玩笑 好嘛 - 不 不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm red lighting you, for real. Okay? - No, don't do that. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就别跟着我了 - 你能听我说完吗 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then stop this. - Can you hear me out? Please? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得圣胡尼佩罗有多少女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many girls do you think there are in San Junipero?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百个 几千个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds? Thousands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,管我什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 天涯何处无芳草 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying there's plenty of other girls out there for you, Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地女孩吗 她们都死气沉沉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The locals? They're like dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来可不像哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little lively for dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不想要无趣的浪漫 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want some kind of boring romance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 那跟把我们放在养老院什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, Jesus, put us in a retirement home deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想找人打炮 选择多得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're looking for someone to fuck, there's options.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再去泥潭转转 - 我们不只是炮友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang out at the Quagmire again. - It's not just sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就是炮友 - 不 我们心有灵犀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was just sex. - No, we made a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯 我们只是炮友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes, it was just sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们没结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - No roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少可以在城里好好玩玩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the town, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给你买杯喝的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好啊 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 啊 是啊 就是个微型手术 大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh… yeah, it was microsurgery, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我的两个膝盖都有磨损了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, both my kneecaps had kind of just worn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 我从来没懂过这首歌 有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never got this song. Kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们跳个舞吧 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we dance? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们只有当下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ All we've got is this moment ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 21世纪已是陈年旧事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The 21st century's yesterday ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到时候我该专心于电脑运算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I guess by the time I'd put my mind to, like, computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢占先机 故事就得另说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, caught that first wave, would have had a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去下洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta use the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道要怎么办 - 什么怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know how to do this. - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我好过些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make this easy for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去我车兜兜风吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get in my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里多久了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long have you been here? - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里多久了 - 圣胡普罗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long have you been here? - In San Junipero?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 几个月了 原本就是想来这放松享受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Couple of months. Plan is long enough to enjoy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我也是个游客 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm a tourist, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 看你表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢吗 - 好大的屋子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You like it? - It's just so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想起来我长大的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminds me of where I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,想你妈妈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没和女人睡过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never slept with a woman before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没别的意思 只是想说 刚才爽翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a critique. I mean, it was fucking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没和女人睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, never with a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没和任何人睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说 城里的 还是 - 没有 谁都没有 哪儿都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, in town or…? - No. No one, nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜你破了我的处 - 我破了你的处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess you deflowered me. - I deflowered you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么着 你活在旧时英格兰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? Merry England?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你有谈过恋爱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had relationships though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 你可是有未婚夫的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! You got a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说来话长 - 哈哈 我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's complicated. - Yeah, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自己喜欢女人的 - 我也喜欢男人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that you liked women? - I like men too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,平等的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equal rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.02,0:22:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是什么时候知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我和一个男人结了婚 婚姻持续了很长一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was married to a guy. A long time, I was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我总是被其它的女孩子吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'd be attracted to other girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,同事 朋友 一些给我服务过的女服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}co-workers, friends, some waitress that served me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都令我着迷 哦天 她们都如此迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were crushes. God, they were crushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从没有采取过行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never acted on any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他相爱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真的爱过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really was in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.70,0:23:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他选择离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he chose not to stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在换我了 我来这溜达会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now it's me. And I'm passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我离开前 一定会玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before I leave, I'll have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's nearly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我们躺在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's lie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到凯丽了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.18,0:24:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 凯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一整晚都没见到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen her all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.66,0:24:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去泥潭看过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried the Quagmire?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:24:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥潭是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the Quagmire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 嘿 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! Hey! - I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我好像在哪见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know you from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tucker's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯丽的朋友吗 - 你知道到哪儿能找到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kelly's friend, huh? - Do you know where to find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么会知道 - 你是她的朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How would I know that? - You're her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.18,0:26:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曾经是 - 她来过这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was a friend. - Has she been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.02,0:27:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.06,0:27:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 试着换个时间段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Try a different time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿你可以试试80，90年代 或者2002年的某一时间段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here in '80, the '90s, 2002 one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.86,0:27:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她值得一试 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worth the shot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,完整地介绍下翻新的克莱斯勒·柯多巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Introducing the totally redesigned Chrysler Cordoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里你能得到想要的奢华\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the luxury you expect is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一加仑的里程\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so is gas mileage…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.42,0:27:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金时代 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golden age, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.94,0:28:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你要玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - You playing or…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.66,0:28:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我在找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然 下次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe… next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.90,0:28:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.18,0:29:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.10,0:29:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.94,0:29:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 选首歌 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Select a song! - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别走 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. No, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.06,0:29:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.30,0:30:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找你 你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for you. Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.54,0:30:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想换首音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like a change of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.10,0:30:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么会是你的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell is this your era?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.50,0:30:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你躲我 - 首先 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hid from me. - One, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.06,0:30:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 我不欠你的 最后 我不欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, I owe you zero. And three… see point two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关谁欠谁的事 这是态度问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about who owes who. It's about manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.46,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.50,0:30:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.74,0:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者应该意味着欢乐 而且这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it should. And this…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不好玩 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not fun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.54,0:30:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不觉得很内疚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.22,0:31:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你应该觉得内疚 或至少有点感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should feel bad. Or at least feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.54,0:31:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过过一个女孩子吗 二十五岁左右的样子 棕色头发 戴眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen a girl? Mid-20s, brown hair, glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.62,0:31:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.78,0:31:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.34,0:32:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的痛觉弧设定为零了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you got your pain slider set to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.02,0:32:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 听着 - 他们有多少人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, listen. - How many of them are dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.90,0:32:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概的比例是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what percentage?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,全时段的人群中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in full-timers?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.50,0:32:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,八十 八十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighty. Eighty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.26,0:33:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.90,0:33:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会跳的 - 我知道 我很抱歉 不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna jump. - I know, and I'm sorry, whatever it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.82,0:33:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前在这的时候 我说过我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the time I've been here, I said I wouldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.38,0:33:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 不会动感情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, do feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的让我手足无措了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freaked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.66,0:33:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想喜欢任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to like anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.90,0:33:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的出现打乱了我的享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been just… totally fucking inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.62,0:33:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how long there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.78,0:33:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我也不能喜欢谁 你的出现和对你的欲望都是意料之外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't. I wasn't prepared for you. For wanting something…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next week it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.30,0:34:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.70,0:34:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给好人格雷格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To nice Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.18,0:34:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定了吗 - 我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure you're going through with that? - I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.82,0:34:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别无选择吗 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.98,0:34:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really is a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.42,0:34:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人不同意我被传送 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my family don't approve, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.74,0:34:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也无力阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他同情我 这让我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he pities me. That pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那也不公平 因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not fair 'cause he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不知道还有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you don't know how much time there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.06,0:35:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.90,0:35:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我三个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.82,0:35:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,癌细胞已经扩散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's spread basically everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在九个月前就这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said three months before six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以咯 你觉得他们真的知道很多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know, what do they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.86,0:35:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至不知道一切是怎样的体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't even taste of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.98,0:35:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你之后要留在这儿吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But so you'll stay here after? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.90,0:35:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我生命终结 我就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm done, I am done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.10,0:35:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这太疯 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's cra… I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.90,0:35:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.42,0:35:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.42,0:36:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫的名字是理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband's name was Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.58,0:36:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他两年前才死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died just two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.22,0:36:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们有过留在生胡尼佩罗的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we had the opportunity to stay in San Junipero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.74,0:36:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,被传送过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.90,0:36:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.50,0:36:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想被传送 - 换作任何人都会接受的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't want to take it. - Why wouldn't anyone take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.38,0:36:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had his viewpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.86,0:36:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有自己相信和不相信的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were things he believed and things he didn't believe in,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.46,0:36:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方就属于他不相信的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this place was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.10,0:36:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,连来都不会来 更不会尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't even visit. Take the trial run.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.06,0:36:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.42,0:36:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道自己想不想尝试 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if I wanted to try it but… I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.54,0:36:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 没有这里 我永远不会遇到像你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, without this place, I never would've met someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.82,0:36:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你可以的 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you could have. - No, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.86,0:37:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在外面依然会遇到 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could have met outside all this. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.54,0:37:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 永远不会遇到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… would not have got me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.70,0:37:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}At all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.54,0:37:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真的遇见\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we really met, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.74,0:37:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真的那样 你也不会喜欢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we really met, you wouldn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.90,0:37:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.98,0:37:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会愿意和我一起玩耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you'd…You wouldn't want to spend time with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来了之后就会 - 有本事试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd come and then… - Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.22,0:37:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.50,0:37:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 休斯顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where are you? Houston?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.14,0:37:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在内华达州卡森城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carson City, Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.98,0:37:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.22,0:37:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.30,0:37:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以去找找 - 加利福尼亚圣罗莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can just look it up. - Santa Rosa, California.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.10,0:37:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离我不远 - 我不希望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's no distance. - I don't want you to…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.58,0:38:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不希望你来见我 我怕 - 我就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want you to see me. I'm scared… - And I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无论什么样都吓不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you are can't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我见见你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.18,0:38:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.38,0:38:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.54,0:39:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.86,0:39:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在我们的自助舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please check in at our self-service pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.70,0:39:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,刷卡登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}using swipe cards provided.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.74,0:39:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定是凯丽 - 我猜我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must be Kelly. - I guess I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.34,0:39:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在等你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's waiting for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.30,0:39:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身体可能没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't be able to physically respond in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.02,0:39:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她能听见你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.54,0:39:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们一些私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.02,0:40:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小笨笨 你好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.90,0:40:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.94,0:40:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你好 请问下 你是凯丽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Hello. Excuse me. Is it… Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.98,0:41:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.42,0:41:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是格雷格 - 你是格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Greg. - You're Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.50,0:41:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.58,0:41:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 在她被传送之前 你能亲自来见她一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think it's great that you came down here in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.58,0:41:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she passes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.94,0:41:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至她的父母都不再来看她了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even her folks don't come visit no more so…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.78,0:41:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要去世了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's passing over?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.54,0:41:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们边喝咖啡边聊吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go grab a coffee. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.34,0:41:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没告诉你吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She didn't tell you? - No, she did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.02,0:41:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她只说自己是去玩玩的 - 更像一个试用版\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Said she was just visiting. - More like sampling the trial version.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我和她相识才三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've only known her the past three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.54,0:41:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在通讯箱里聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talk on the comm box.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.14,0:41:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉你她是怎样成为植物人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told you how she ended up quadriplegic?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.30,0:41:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她这样多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how long she's been that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.90,0:41:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她21岁的一个晚上 她向父母出柜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night, she's 21, comes out to her folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.34,0:42:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对此有些恼火\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a little uptight about it, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她 他们不想要一个同性恋女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told her they don't want a gay daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.94,0:42:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那不正常 之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not natural and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.10,0:42:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们吵了一架 她开车的时候偏离了道路 然后邦的一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fight. She gets in her car. Runs it off the road. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.22,0:42:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她那时才21 - 40多年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When she was 21? - More than 40 years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.42,0:42:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上她是这样过了一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been her whole lifetime, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.54,0:42:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以整个生胡尼佩罗系统对她来说很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the whole San Junipero system has been a big deal for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.14,0:42:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biggest deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.74,0:42:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被传送之后 就能永远待那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course now, until she passes over, it goes permanent,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.74,0:42:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而之前 她每个星期只有5个小时的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's on a five-hour weekly limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.22,0:42:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.18,0:42:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时间是他们按量分的 也不愿意再多加些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ration it out. They don't trust us with more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.74,0:42:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说时间太久你会疯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you go crazy if you have too much, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.82,0:42:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长时间坐着 精神和肉体分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't leave your seat. You disassociate body from mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.78,0:42:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本就是老年之家里的常态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that doesn't happen in every senior home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.70,0:42:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统存在的主要意义是为了治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system's there for therapeutic reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.22,0:42:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,身临其境的怀旧疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}immersive nostalgia therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你浸入到记忆的深海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plunge you into a world of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.54,0:42:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说这有助于老年痴呆患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps with Alzheimer's, that's what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.94,0:42:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小的仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small mercies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.70,0:43:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.10,0:43:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这桩婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this marriage…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.10,0:43:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于执行安乐死 国家规定需要三层授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state's got a triple lockdown on euthanasia cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.26,0:43:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要医生 病人和一个家庭成员签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta have a sign-off from the doc, the patient, a family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.46,0:43:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以避免人们为了待在圣胡尼佩罗 选择死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's to stop folks from passing over just because they prefer San Junipero flat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.94,0:43:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是约克夏的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, Yorkie's family,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.42,0:43:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是非常虔诚的宗教主义者 所以肯定不会签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're big-time religious, and they will not sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.14,0:43:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是配偶的权利可以超越他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a spouse can override them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.42,0:43:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你们才决定结婚 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hence the wedding bells. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.66,0:43:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天上午会有一个牧师过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a pastor coming tomorrow A.M.,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的传送被排在下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then she's scheduled to pass tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.70,0:43:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划传送 还是说她时日不多了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Scheduled to pass." Let's just call it dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.14,0:43:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你愿意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can call it dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.22,0:43:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她的记忆传至云端 听起来就像是去了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uploaded to the cloud, sounds like heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.30,0:43:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.26,0:43:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会穿礼服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna wear a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.54,0:43:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚仪式就在我休息的时候举办\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony's on my coffee break.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.42,0:43:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没结过婚 所以我想 有什么所谓呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never married so I just figured, you know, what's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.82,0:44:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.26,0:44:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不足挂齿 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the least I could do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.42,0:44:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在能帮我们连接到系统中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you could hook us up to the system now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.62,0:44:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她被传送之前 就小一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for a little while, before she passes?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.74,0:44:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后还能见到她 我是说 那时候她就一直在那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still see her afterwards. I mean, then she's no limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.42,0:44:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那时候就是个全职的圣胡尼佩罗胖子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's full, fat, permanent San Juniperan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.34,0:44:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是你能不能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.58,0:44:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 这里看得很紧 监视器到处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, it is so tight here that they monitor every…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.26,0:44:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.66,0:44:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你们5分钟 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got five minutes. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.94,0:45:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.38,0:45:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没在白天来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been here during the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.70,0:45:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.42,0:45:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我得快点说 我刚和格雷格聊过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I gotta be quick. So I spoke to Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.30,0:45:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.90,0:45:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打算明天走 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're passing over tomorrow? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.66,0:45:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼过后几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of hours after the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.14,0:45:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我猜 理论上来说我将永远在这里度蜜月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess I am technically honeymooning here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.42,0:45:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.14,0:45:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我接下来的话可能会有些疯狂 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna say something crazy. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.78,0:45:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我结婚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna marry me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.10,0:45:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 格雷格看起来不错 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… Greg seems great, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.58,0:45:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不嫁给和你心心牵挂的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not someone you've connected with?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.86,0:46:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是答应了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.34,0:46:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你合法的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be your lawfully wedded wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.22,0:46:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,相爱相守 无论疾病还是健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have and to hold, in sickness and in health,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.62,0:46:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是好是坏 富裕或贫穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}in good times and in woe, for richer, for poorer…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.42,0:47:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.86,0:47:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.54,0:48:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.70,0:48:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.18,0:48:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.74,0:48:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.02,0:49:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来见我都不打扮一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't dress up to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.10,0:49:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.42,0:49:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.98,0:49:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.22,0:49:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.38,0:49:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.38,0:49:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.62,0:49:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好真实啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.22,0:49:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好真实啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels so real!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.46,0:49:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么呢 - 哦 我好喜欢这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Oh, I love it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.38,0:49:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好喜欢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.46,0:49:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以前也来过啊 - 但是现在我住在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been here before. - But now I live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.70,0:49:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.38,0:49:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在就和你在一起 - 我说的不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with you now. - That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.82,0:50:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当你寿命将尽的时候 - 约克夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When it's your time. - Yorkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下来陪我 - 我们不能只享受现在嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here with me. - Can we just enjoy tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.98,0:50:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经快半夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.06,0:50:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有十分钟 你就要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In ten minutes, you're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要等一周才能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I gotta wait a week to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.22,0:50:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我只是游客 - 那 几个月之后呢 会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I'm just a visitor. - What, a couple of months, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.42,0:50:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们别讨论这个 - 之后你就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not discussing this. - Then you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.22,0:50:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就不存在了 你本可以永生的 - 永生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just gone. You could have forever. - Forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.14,0:50:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁能定义永生 - 依你所想 多久都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who can even make sense of forever? - However long you want then.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.46,0:50:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你那样就可以永远拜托自己的难题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you can remove yourself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.02,0:50:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你看看啊 天哪 你摸一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at it! Jesus! Touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.50,0:50:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要走了 - 嘿 哦 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going. - Hey! Oh. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.70,0:50:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.86,0:50:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.86,0:50:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.02,0:50:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 别骗自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.62,0:50:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那只是个手势\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that was just a gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.42,0:50:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你娶了我 - 那是为了给你最后的慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You married me. - To help you pass over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.22,0:51:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一种善意 - 那你离开可就不善意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As a… Kindness. - It's not so kind to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.10,0:51:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 听着 我很抱歉 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, look, I'm sorry, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.14,0:51:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有了这次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.70,0:51:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有了这次机会 我想和你一起分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this chance. I wanna share it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.22,0:51:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.94,0:51:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你愧疚是因为你老公不在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? You feel bad because your husband isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.86,0:51:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为那是他的选择 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because that was his choice. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.82,0:51:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有选择留在这 就和离开你没有区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chose not to stay here. It's like he left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.46,0:51:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 他可以选择留下 但是他选择了离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he could have stayed, but he chose to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.62,0:51:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在胡言乱语 - 你应该生他的气才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know what you're saying. - You should be mad at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.98,0:51:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而不是拿内疚惩罚自己 - 离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not whipping yourself with guilt. - Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.10,0:51:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不清 但是他的所作所为都很自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see it! But what he did, it was selfish actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.66,0:51:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十九年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-nine years…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.26,0:52:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他在一起四49年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with him for 49 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.58,0:52:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't begin to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.30,0:52:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.70,0:52:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间的纽带 承诺 繁琐\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bond, the commitment, the boredom,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.34,0:52:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望 欢笑 爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the yearning, the laughter, the love of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.78,0:52:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间的爱情 你根本无法体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking love. You just cannot know!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.34,0:52:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们牺牲的所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.90,0:52:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们互相陪伴的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The years I gave him. The years he gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.50,0:52:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想过要问问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.82,0:52:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想过要问问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it occur to you to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.98,0:52:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.10,0:52:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alison.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.26,0:52:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,难伺候的美丽小公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always difficult, always beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.22,0:52:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,39岁就死了 望她安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died at 39 years old, bless her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.02,0:52:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德和我心如刀割\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Richard and I, we felt that heartbreak as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.54,0:52:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有是你才受过罪 滚你丫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only person ever suffered, go fuck yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.38,0:52:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我不知道 - 是根本没想过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I didn't know… - Didn't think to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.14,0:53:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 理查德死前和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when he was dying, Richard said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.74,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当时给他这个选择 死后被传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they offered him this, to pass over, pass through,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.46,0:53:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你热爱的这个操蛋墓地里永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend eternity in this fucking graveyard you're so in love with,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.22,0:53:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回答的是 「我怎么能选择永生 她错失了这样的机会之后 我怎么能选择永生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said, "How can I? When she missed out, how can I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.18,0:53:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他真正地去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.78,0:53:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是希望能让自己相信 他在陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish I could believe he's with her now,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在一起 但是我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they're together, but I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.46,0:53:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他们不存在了 就和你说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe they're nowhere. Just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.02,0:53:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在了 不 我同情你 真相就是 我同情你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone. No, I pitied you, and that's the truth. I pitied you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.18,0:53:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你却在这里告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you give me some sales pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.66,0:53:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋的永恒有多么完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how fucking peachy forever could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.62,0:53:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.74,0:53:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想永远生活在一个毫无激情的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna spend forever somewhere nothing matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.78,0:53:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后落得和韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}End up like Wes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.90,0:53:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些迷失在泥潭的渣滓一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those lost fucks at the Quagmire.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.10,0:53:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用尽力气只为感受点激情 那走好不送\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying anything to feel something, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.46,0:53:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恕不奉陪 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm out. I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.46,0:53:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽 对不起 凯丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, I'm sorry. Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.70,0:56:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 凯丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.02,0:56:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.06,0:57:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 那好吧 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, okay then. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.46,0:57:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.54,0:57:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑了所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All things considered…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.74,0:57:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.70,0:57:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.10,0:57:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.58,0:58:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 噢 亲爱的 你知道它的价值吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, baby, do you know what that's worth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.10,0:58:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 天堂就在人间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, heaven is a place on Earth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.38,0:58:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们说，在天堂爱情至上 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ They say in heaven love comes first ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.38,0:58:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们将在这人间造出一个天堂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll make heaven a place on Earth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.18,0:58:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 天堂就在人间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, heaven is a place on Earth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.90,0:58:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当我感到孤独时 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When I feel alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我偎依在你身旁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I reach for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.58,0:58:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你要带我回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And you bring me home ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.06,0:58:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失在那片海 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When I'm lost at sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.58,0:58:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我听到你的声音 让我继续前行 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I hear your voice and it carries me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.18,0:58:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.34,0:58:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 在这个世界我们才刚刚开始 ∮ - 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ In this world we're just beginning ∮ - Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.34,0:59:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去理解这生命的奇迹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To understand the miracle of living ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.38,0:59:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我只是不够勇敢 ∮ - 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Maybe I wasn't brave before ∮ - Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.54,0:59:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我已无所畏惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But I'm not afraid anymore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.14,0:59:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 噢 宝贝 你可知道这可值得 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, baby, do you know what that's worth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.74,0:59:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 天堂就在人间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, heaven is a place on Earth ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.74,0:59:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们说，在天堂爱情至上 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ They say in heaven love comes first ∮
